{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261118/photo/bkn-20261118013054330-1118_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261118030820\"/><p>警員押被捕司機搜車。</p><p>昨日(17日)晚上9時54分，執法部門接報指一輛停泊在北角丹拿道2A對開的白色私家車，車上兩名男子懷疑吸毒。警員接報到場調查，在車上發現懷疑毒品，當場拘捕兩人，案件列「販運危險藥物」，毒品價值有待點算。根據網上圖片所見，3名警員將其中一名疑犯按地制服。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T19:19:32.615311+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T17:30:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T19:12:59.573286+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T19:12:59.573286+00:00","content_hash":"8d50eacdb649dd790db161d48966df1e7d7f74705a204f9e930f843a5cf81b46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}